    "name": "loss_pairwise_rank_gap_negexp_weighted_mean",
    "intuition": "Transform the pairwise weighted loss using an exponential negative rank gap weighting but aggregate using a weighted mean instead of sum to normalize across pairs. This normalizes the overall loss by total weights, stabilizing updates across batches of varying size or importance weighting.",
